---
/**
 * Coaching page: “Our Coaching services” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-d17be3e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="d17be3e"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-0467c19 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="0467c19"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-39952e6 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="39952e6"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Our Coaching services</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-e8421ed vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="e8421ed"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <p>
            <span style="font-weight: 400;"
              >Our coaching build the capabilities required for sustainable business growth, leadership excellence, and
              long-term performance.
            </span><span style="font-weight: 400;"
              >We focus on practical, high-impact competencies enabling individuals, teams, businesses and teams to
              thrive in dynamic environments.
            </span><span style="font-weight: 400;"
              >Each program is structured and customised for based on our proprietary Coaching Methodology after
              Baselining and Benchmarking, to align with the specific needs, goals and context of the individual or
              organisation.</span>
          </p><p>
            <span style="font-weight: 400;"
              >The programs outlined below represent key areas of focus and can be adapted, combined, or expanded to
              meet specific individual, team, or organisational requirements.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
